{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-verbs-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T09:38:35.441Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1451e70d97e1f2809daca30b7a3ac26450629c63172dd9e573a68ef66d76ba16","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"I've set up the brief, but it won't run until the Hermes gateway is started.\n\n- **Schedule:** 07:45 Chicago time daily, saved as 12:45 UTC. That matches CDT until the clocks change on 1 November. After that, the job needs to move to 13:45 UTC to keep 07:45 local.\n- **Start date:** The scheduler reported the next run as 25 October, not 15 October, which is what \"starting tomorrow\" means from the 14 October simulation date. I haven't been able to confirm the start date, so check it once the gateway is running.\n- **Content:** Each brief covers new messages in #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford and posts in #strategic-random. Finance figures are left out and pointed to #strategic-pod. Direct messages are not included.\n- **Reply:** I've replied to you in #strategic-random with these details."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
